Package: lemma
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Lemma contributors <noreply@lemma.local>
Homepage: https://github.com/Danyal-0-1/lemma
Depends: bash (>= 4.3), ca-certificates, coreutils, git, @PYTHON_DEPENDS@, util-linux
Recommends: hicolor-icon-theme, openssh-client, xdg-utils
Description: Local-first R&D agent studio and Git workbench
 Lemma organizes research-agent teams, reviewed findings, and Git-tracked
 project workspaces in a browser-based interface that runs entirely on the
 local machine.
 .
 The backend and frontend bind only to loopback. Provider credentials and
 mutable application data remain in private per-user XDG directories.
